## Element
  S Scene Heading mark=. keys (Ctrl+1) name=Scene Heading (Ctrl+1)
  S Action mark=! keys (Ctrl+2) name=Action (Ctrl+2)
  S Character mark=@ keys (Ctrl+3) name=Character (Ctrl+3)
  S Parenthetical mark=() keys (Ctrl+4) name=Parenthetical (Ctrl+4)
  S Dialogue mark=“ keys (Ctrl+5) name=Dialogue (Ctrl+5)
  S Transition mark=> keys (Ctrl+6) name=Transition (Ctrl+6)
  S Centered mark=>< keys (Ctrl+7) name=Centered (Ctrl+7)
  S Lyrics mark=~ keys (Ctrl+8) name=Lyrics (Ctrl+8)
